<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower Monday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 560.62, off 0.32.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 266 to 235.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,549,920, compared with 15,697,600 Friday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
